Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Upload a blog post image (multipart — see category image example)
POST {{baseUrl}}/blog-posts/{{blogPostId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
# (multipart upload — copy the category image body shape)

### Delete a blog post image
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/blog-posts/{{blogPostId}}/images/{{imageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reorder blog post images
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/blog-posts/{{blogPostId}}/images/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderedImageIds": ["{{imageId}}"]
}

### Set a blog post's primary image
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/blog-posts/{{blogPostId}}/images/{{imageId}}/primary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


